lame.min.js is the unmodified lamejs 1.2.1 file from
https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/lamejs/1.2.1/lame.min.js
(https://github.com/zhuker/lamejs). Its license is LGPL-3.0, in lame.LICENSE.
It stays a separate file so it can be replaced. LAME: https://lame.sourceforge.net/

hit_builder.js, hp_hpbars.js and hpbars_base.vpk are pinned copies of the
Hitsound Builder and HP Bar Builder from deadlockconfig.com. The site owner
confirmed that reusing jcStani and HoppCX's work is fine in this case.
Shiv runs only these pinned files. A newer script fetched by complock-watch
is never executed; the watch records that the builder changed and waits
for a reviewed update of the pin.
